/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 166 0 R
/E (This query evaluates customer purchasing habits and order success rates across the platform. The SELECT clause retrieves the customer's name, uses COUNT to determine their total number of placements, and applies conditional aggregation with SUM\(CASE WHEN...\) to separate successful payments \('Lunas'\) from cancelled orders \('Dibatalkan'\). By grouping the final output by the customer's name using the GROUP BY clause, the query successfully isolates individual buyer profiles to easily distinguish highly loyal shoppers from high-risk or churned accounts.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
