297 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 169 0 R
/E (This project successfully transforms raw e-commerce data into valuable strategic insights by analyzing performance from two synchronized tracks. The product analysis reveals which items drive the highest revenue versus volume, allowing the business to optimize inventory and marketing budgets for top categories. Concurrently, the customer behavior analysis effectively maps buyer loyalty and highlights potential revenue leakage from cancelled orders. Ultimately, this project demonstrates how a collaborative data pipeline and clean relational queries can deliver a comprehensive, 360-degree view of retail health to drive data-informed business decisions.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
